/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which character you choose to play as will greatly affect your experience, and it\u2019s recommended to try to play as both characters to get the fullest picture of their world and understand how and why it can reach a dead end because of your choices or lack thereof, and to figure out how to avoid it happening.</p>",
    "short_description": "In the mind of a daydreamer you find a shameful story set in a world that hides filthy secrets, disturbing lore and complicated families behind cute colors. Be careful - or don\u2019t be. But your choices and actions will have consequences. And sometimes the results can be \u2026 inhuman.",
